<title>GERMANY: German traders seek 50,000 T intervention rye.</title>
<headline>German traders seek 50,000 T intervention rye.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>German grain traders bid for 50,000 tonnes of intervention rye, traders said on Thursday.</p>
<p>No price was given for the intervention rye.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
